        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಬಡ್ತಿ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಡ್ತಿ — baḍti — \"a promotion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಈ ವರ್ಷ ನನ್ನ ಅಕ್ಕನಿಗೆ ಬಡ್ತಿ ಸಿಕ್ಕಿತು. ī varṣa nanna akkanige baḍti sikkitu. This year my elder sister got a promotion."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಡ್ತಿ (baḍti) ಕೊಡು, to promote; ಬಡ್ತಿ (baḍti) ಪಡೆ, to be promoted."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಡ್ತಿ (baḍti) is usually traced to Hindustani baṛhtī, \"growth, increase\"; the path into Kannada is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
